  cps asegs (ASTA RTA Σ1 PMc (smid Σ mX B gp s0A s1A s2A s3A s4A s5A s6A s7A s8A s9A s10A s11A F fc n lo P tr tb j0))
            (ASTA RTA Σ1 PMc sfin).
